{"id":754,"date":"2026-01-21T06:29:27","date_gmt":"2026-01-21T06:29:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/?post_type=events&#038;p=754"},"modified":"2026-02-27T12:56:45","modified_gmt":"2026-02-27T12:56:45","slug":"a4i-launch-event","status":"publish","type":"events","link":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/events\/a4i-launch-event\/","title":{"rendered":"A4I Launch Event"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The event brought together senior dignitaries from government, industry, philanthropy, and media to inaugurate A4I\u2019s mission of leveraging artificial intelligence for social impact. Over 60 attendees\u2014including senior IAS officers from the Indian and Karnataka governments, senior executives of philanthropic foundations, technology executives, and media representatives\u2014participated in the launch.&nbsp;Uma Mahadevan, Development Commissioner and Additional Chief Secretary, Government of Karnataka, was the chief guest.&nbsp;Kate Behncken, Corporate Vice President, Microsoft Philanthropies, was the guest of honor.&nbsp;Prof Debabrata Das, Director, IIIT Bangalore, was the dignitary host of the event.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-b3f9bc1d wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"737\" height=\"405\" src=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/image-2-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-940\" srcset=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/image-2-1.webp 737w, https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/image-2-1-300x165.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 737px) 100vw, 737px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"737\" height=\"405\" src=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/image-2-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-940\" srcset=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/image-2-1.webp 737w, https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/image-2-1-300x165.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 737px) 100vw, 737px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The key moments of the event are captured below.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"border-top-color:#d8d8d8;border-top-width:1px;padding-top:1.5rem\">Welcome Address by Prof Debabrata Das, Director, IIIT Bangalore<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-b3f9bc1d wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/image-14.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-947\" srcset=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/image-14.png 560w, https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/image-14-300x168.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 560px) 100vw, 560px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Prof Das opened the event by welcoming all attendees and outlining IIITB\u2019s commitment to inclusive innovation. He highlighted the institute\u2019s history of fostering research that addresses societal challenges across health, education, and livelihoods and introduced A4I as a natural extension of this mission. Emphasizing the importance of partnerships, particularly with Microsoft, he set the tone for collaborative, population-scale AI solutions for underserved communities.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\